hdw4s (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Images copied in the browser can be pasted into the desktop, and images
    copied in the desktop can be pasted back. Formatted text still arrives as
    plain text.
  * Files can be moved in and out of a session. They live in the account's
    Downloads folder, which is also the only directory the browser can reach.
  * A desktop can be shared with a second viewer. Nobody reaches a session
    without a credential either way.
  * A session can drive a second display, which appears as another browser
    window.

 -- Markus Gutschke <gutschke@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 16:20:43 -0700

